  - title: 02 / Extend the cable at midscale
    explanation: "Select 50% TANK, then fit the 350 \u03A9 cable. Receiver current
      and voltage stay at 12 mA and 3.00 V. The transmitter has about 4.80 V across
      it after the cable change."
    caption: "50% TANK  \u2022  12 mA  \u2022  3.00 V AT RX"
    parts:
    - id: positive
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.72}
