  - title: 03 / Find the voltage limit
    explanation: "At 100% with the long cable, 600 \u03A9 of cable and receiver resistance
      leaves no headroom at 20 mA. With 10 V available to the load, current is about
      16.67 mA. The receiver reads 4.17 V and decodes about 79%."
    caption: THE TRANSMITTER NEEDS 2.0 V OF HEADROOM
    parts:
    - id: positive
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.72}
      label: 12 V +
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.35, b: 0.42, a: 1}
