  - title: 04 / Restore full scale and test the break
    explanation: "Fit the 50 \u03A9 cable to recover 20 mA and 5.00 V at RX. Open
      the line and confirm that 0 mA reports LINE OPEN. Close it again and verify
      the 100% reading returns."
    caption: "20 mA FULL SCALE  \u2022  0 mA OPEN LINE"
    parts:
    - id: positive
      kind: 9
